    "regime_notes": "Full sample clears benchmark absolute IC and ICIR gates. Results are regime-sensitive: 2026+ IC -0.022958/ICIR -0.069864, 2027+ IC 0.018015/ICIR 0.056091, and 2028 YTD IC 0.239194/ICIR 0.869952. Small cross-section requires conservative interpretation.",
    "validation_method": "Daily cross-sectional Spearman IC; minimum 8 valid instruments per date; 20-day forward close-to-close return; one-session signal lag.",
